   "versio": "1.0.0",
   "descripcio": {
    "ca": "Els assistents d'IA a la placa: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity i Copilot. Obre un xat nou amb un toc, copia la resposta o el codi, i fes servir les dreceres de cada un. Cada assistent té la seva pantalla, que surt sola quan el tens al davant.",
    "en": "AI assistants on the board: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity and Copilot. Open a new chat with one tap, copy the answer or the code, and use each one's shortcuts. Each assistant has its own screen, which shows up by itself when it's in front.",
